<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40927" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-gusto</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to taste again</i> or <i>repeatedly</i> (very rare). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bilem suam regustantes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Prov. 3, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regustatum digito terebrare salinum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>licked out</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					5, 138</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">illam (laudationem Lollii) legi, volo tamen
					regustare,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to read again</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 13, 48, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crebro regusto litteras,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 13, 13, 3</span></i>
			: ille Latinus <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀττικισμὸς</span> ex
			intervallo regustandus, <i><span class="en">id. ib. 4, 17,
			1</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
